; T-0015D golden: RoscosmGeo.zmp - repeat/until, shr, $30, 'and' precedence, Pos, Copy,
; string indexing past the end (T3: GetUrlBase[length+1] yields #0), break, inc, a 'for' with
; a computed zero-trip bound.
; GetURLBase = 'http://geoportal.ntsomz.ru/coverages/&src=images&date=&type=jpg' (63 bytes).
; dec2bin(x) builds the binary string LSB-first via chr($30 + (x and 1)) then x:=x shr 1,
; repeat/until x=0 (so dec2bin(0) would loop forever - never hit by GetX/GetY>=0 with the
; corpus's non-zero P1 padding path, since dec2bin(0)='0' terminates: x=0 satisfies
; 'until x=0' after the FIRST iteration, s='0').
; Pos('&',B)=38 (also '&src='); Pos('&date=',B)=49; Pos('&type=',B)=55.
; posFirstAND=37 -> ResultURL starts 'http://geoportal.ntsomz.ru/coverages/' (Copy(B,1,37)).
; &src= value is 'images' (chars 43..48, terminated by the '&' at 49) -> '.../images'.
; then '/'+IntToStr(GetZ-1)+'/'.
; &date= value is empty (position 55 IS '&', so the while loop's condition is false on the
; first check, i stays at posDATE+6=55, i-(posDATE+6)=0, not >0 -> no date segment emitted).
; binX:=dec2bin(GetX), binY:=dec2bin(GetY), each left-padded with '0' to length (GetZ-1).
; then for i:=7 to GetZ-1: append Copy(binY,1,i-6)+'-'+Copy(binX,1,i-6)+'/' (empty loop when
; GetZ-1<7, i.e. P1/P2); finally append binY+'-'+binX.
; &type= value is 'jpg' (chars 61..63, then GetUrlBase[64] reads #0 per T3 since 64 is in
; [Length+1,Length+16]=[64,79], so the while loop's break fires via the length check before
; ever needing the #0 fallback) -> '.jpg'.
; P1: GetZ-1=0 -> binX=binY='0' (dec2bin(0), no padding needed, len already 0>=0... the for
;   i:=1 to (0-1) pad loop is zero-trip); the digit-join for loop (7 to 0) is zero-trip.
; P2: GetZ-1=1 -> binX=binY='1' (dec2bin(1)='1', pad loop 1 to (1-1)=0 zero-trip); digit-join
;   loop (7 to 1) zero-trip.
; P3: GetZ-1=13 -> binX=dec2bin(1234) padded to 13 bits, binY=dec2bin(5678) padded to 13.
; P4: GetZ-1=17 -> binX=dec2bin(131071)='11111111111111111' (17 ones, already 17 bits, no pad
;   needed), binY=dec2bin(87654) padded to 17 bits.

